            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Kent-Corson, Malinda Louise. (2005). Cenozoic Surface Elevation in Southwestern Montana and Eastern Idaho: A Stable Isotope Study. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: http://purl.stanford.edu/xb105nq7903",
